{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788616342000-c2553e", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "帮起草一个新员工导师制的简版方案，适用一线工人。", "id": "97156144e5b54be2bfb1a0e647e480ca", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:52:22", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "bb56625a55dd4cdc9b63ea85fba4a613", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:52:22", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "1dbef52d4cdd4d168ad40d30b617c886", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:52:30", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:53:02"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**一线新员工导师制（简版）**\n1. 适用：入职 3 个月内新员工\n2. 导师资格：同岗 2 年以上、近半年无质量事故，津贴 300 元/徒\n3. 带教期：4 周（第 1 周安全+基础，第 2–3 周实操，第 4 周独立作业考核）\n4. 出师标准：独立完成本岗位 SOP 全流程，质检一次合格\n5. 考核：徒弟转正且一次合格率≥95%，导师津贴全额发放并计入评优。", "id": "02d2e94b3d294b8da778d04aaf92d656", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:52:30", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:53:02"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "354522dd8fff4f6190e2fa523fcfaeec", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:52:30", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:53:02", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "导师津贴从哪个科目走？", "id": "8d0ef2b751f64364a055b8fc53de86e3", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:58:22", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "c98ce06a328746d18f28256b5825019f", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:58:22", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "763458cc562a409bb1d3fd7e60596c1e", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:58:30", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:59:02"}, {"type": "text", "text": "走「职工教育经费」或生产部培训费二级科目均可；建议计入培训费，月度随工资表单独列示「带教津贴」，便于统计投入产出（每徒 1,200 元 vs 减少的返工损失）。", "id": "d239e57a48154bf4937fcaea1d722cbe", "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:58:30", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:59:02"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "f82ae462857641ffb49cbb4d51099318", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T13:58:30", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-05T13:59:02", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "二维码签到没手机怎么办？", "id": "0fd2240f8b9746858ec978a97be58b54", "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:02", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "8085d785d16f4c15976148ab2ffdadcf", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:02", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "188468afd16e49dbb3cddbc8b0a2b7b4", "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:08", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:47"}, {"type": "text", "text": "一线老员工多的班组保留纸质签到表，班长代扫+本人按手印双保险；或者用工牌（一卡通）打卡机，跟考勤系统打通后自动计学时。", "id": "fa5729ea3fe048279a9982236a6a42dd", "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:08", "finished_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:47"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "04a5e28932844f1a89b59ed63bc98c61", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:08", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-05T14:01:47", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}